# Notes for Maintenance
# =================================================
# Review this file when:
# 1. New benchmark datasets are added
# 2. New build tools generate new artifact types
# 3. New testing frameworks create new report formats
# 4. Repository structure changes significantly
#
# To validate exclusions:
# 1. Create a test PR with typical changes
# 2. Check WTD summary token usage in dashboard
# 3. Review "Files analyzed" section in WTD output
# 4. Add patterns for unexpected generated files
